    "excerpt": "In this comprehensive guide, you'll learn about Local Storage and Session Storage in JavaScript, including their differences, usage scenarios, and practical examples to enhance your web applications. Perfect for beginners, this tutorial provides a step-by-step approach to mastering these important web storage APIs.",
    "sourceUrl": "",
