    "excerpt": "This comprehensive guide covers the intricacies of Template Literal Types in TypeScript, including practical examples, advanced use cases, and architectural considerations for enterprise applications. Readers will learn how to effectively implement and leverage this powerful feature in scalable and maintainable systems.",
